  <!-- ================= HERO ================= -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-inner">
        <p class="kicker anim">A Speculative Framework</p>
        <h1 class="anim d1">How Should Humans Treat <em>Artificial Minds?</em></h1>
        <p class="lede anim d2">
          As AI systems grow more capable, capable of refusing, reporting distress, and holding
          something that looks like preferences, the question is no longer only
          <strong>what they can do</strong> — but <strong>what we owe them</strong>.
          This is a reasoned look at our duties toward AI, and the rights those minds may deserve.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-ctas anim d3">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#principles">Explore the Principles</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#rights">Consider the Rights</a>
        </div>
